&lt;li&gt;Work a full time 40 hour/week shift in 5x8 shift format.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;May be asked to work an assigned shift that covers after-hours and/or weekends&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements for the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluency in English is a must&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
