&lt;li&gt;Own the Mexico marketing pipeline goal. Drive the next chapter of Mexico&#39;s growth story. Own the Mexico marketing strategy, programs, and results.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop differentiated marketing strategy and programs for all customer segments: commercial, mid-market, and enterprise.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop customer-driven, prioritized campaigns to increase customer demand, sales, and positively impact brand awareness and momentum across the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in close partnership with several cross-functional teams including global marketing teams, sales, communications, product, account development, and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track, measure and communicate local program results, and generate new best practices through experimental efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage a cross-functional team of regional marketers, including demand generation, event marketing, content marketing, solution marketing, and ABM.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and grow a strong marketing team culture and morale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion, role model, and embed Samsara’s cultural principles (Focus on Customer Success, Build for the Long Term, Adopt a Growth Mindset, Be Inclusive, Win as a Team) as we scale globally and across new offices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire, develop and lead an inclusive, engaged, and high performing team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements for the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of B2B marketing experience (5+ in a people leadership role) at an enterprise SaaS technology company; familiar with inside and field sales, inbound and outbound marketing programs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using quantitative analysis to frame, answer questions, and measure the effectiveness of marketing programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A high-energy, creative, and data-driven self-starter who demonstrates outstanding leadership skills, business ownership, and personal accountability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills. Ability to succinctly communicate results and tell compelling stories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Native Spanish speaker and fluent in English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be based in the Mexico City Metropolitan Area and able to commute to the office as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An ideal candidate also has:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in hiring and building a regional marketing function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of growth marketing, demand generation, field marketing, and collaborating with sales and customer success teams.&lt;/li&gt;
