&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4-6 years (or more) of product design management experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong portfolio that showcases ability to lead teams that ship elegant solutions to complex problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
