&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 300; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Samsara (NYSE: IOT) is the pioneer of the Connected Operations™ Cloud, which is a platform that enables organizations that depend on physical operations to harness Internet of Things (IoT) data to develop actionable insights and improve their operations. At Samsara, we are helping improve the safety, efficiency and sustainability of the physical operations that power our global economy. Representing more than 40% of global GDP, these industries are the infrastructure of our planet, including agriculture, construction, field services, transportation, and manufacturing — and we are excited to help digitally transform their operations at scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 300; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Working at Samsara means you’ll help define the future of physical operations and be on a team that’s shaping an exciting array of product solutions, including Video-Based Safety, Vehicle Telematics, Apps and Driver Workflows, and Equipment Monitoring. As part of a recently public company, you’ll have the autonomy and support to make an impact as we build for the long term.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role owns how Samsara consistently hires exceptional talent across EMEA at pace. As Senior Manager, Recruiting – EMEA, you&#39;ll lead a team of recruiters covering non-quota-carrying and R&amp;amp;D hiring across the region — spanning Engineering, R&amp;amp;D, Sales Engineering, and G&amp;amp;A/Marketing/Corp — providing both strategic partnership and hands-on execution. Your job is to build a function that delivers exceptional hires today and gets stronger over time: clearer profiles, stronger signals, better candidate experience, and better decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll report to the Director of Recruiting, EMEA, and act as the primary recruiting leader for Director + stakeholders within your business areas across the region, bringing the technical credibility and executive presence to be trusted from day one on senior and specialist searches.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hybrid position based in the London area.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a team of recruiters covering non-quota-carrying and R&amp;amp;D hiring across EMEA — including Engineering, R&amp;amp;D, Sales Engineering, and G&amp;amp;A/Marketing/Corp — holding a clear, well-calibrated bar for talent across the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach and develop recruiters, helping them grow from strong execution into independent ownership: planning searches, driving reqs to close, and holding stakeholder trust&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the recruiting relationship with Director + engineering and business stakeholders across EMEA, building deep enough business and technical context to be a credible, consultative partner rather than an order-taker.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Combine strategic partnership with senior stakeholders and direct hands-on execution on the most complex or specialist searches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring data-driven rigor to diagnosing and fixing recruiting problems: read funnel data, spot contradictions, identify what&#39;s broken, and build a practical plan with clear leading and lagging indicators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve signal-to-noise at every stage of the process: sharper role definition, stronger screens, and more consistent interview evaluation and calibration with hiring managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design a research-centric approach to hiring across EMEA: talent mapping, deliberate outreach, and long-term relationship building, adapted to the specific dynamics of European talent markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with People Partners and business leaders to learn from great hires and mis-hires, then update profiles, assessment, and closing approaches based on what&#39;s learned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Model Samsara&#39;s values: embed inclusivity, long-term vision, and teamwork into all aspects of hiring and leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements for the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert experience in full-cycle recruiting, with credible depth in senior software engineering hiring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience of leading and developing recruiting teams across multiple disciplines and locations via both in person and remote leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to build trust and executive presence with senior level stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong bar-setting and coaching skills, with a track record of building recruiters from good execution to sought after talent partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating across multiple recruiting disciplines simultaneously (technical + Sales Engineering + G&amp;amp;A/Corp), rather than a single specialism.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong pluses:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sales Engineering and/or G&amp;amp;A recruiting experience, alongside core engineering hiring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Director+ level search experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;EMEA-scale recruiting leadership, ideally spanning multiple countries/markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;The range of annual base salary for full-time employees for this position is below. Please note that base pay offered may vary depending on factors including your city of residence, job-related knowledge, skills, and experience. This role is also eligible for an initial RSU grant with no vesting cliff, and ongoing refresh opportunities tied to performance, subject to plan terms and conditions. Learn more about our total rewards and benefits below.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Base Salary&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£104,400&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£130,500 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Total Rewards&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
