&lt;p&gt;Samsara is looking for a Business Operations analyst to play a critical role in scaling our post-sales organization — spanning renewals and customer success. The role includes being the expert on critical data sources, weaving that data into analysis that drives insights across the post-sales business. This person will optimize post-sales performance by designing standardized processes, driving adherence across teams, and turning data into recommendations for leadership and managers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is open to candidates residing in the US &lt;strong&gt;except&lt;/strong&gt; the San Francisco Bay Metro Area, NYC Metro Area, and Washington, D.C. Metro Area.&lt;/p&gt;
