&lt;li&gt;Own analytics and trend reporting for an assigned segment or workstream within renewals and customer success (for example, the long-tail/at-scale customer base), serving as the go-to analyst for leadership and frontline managers on that area.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extract and reconcile data across Salesforce, financial systems, and customer success platforms, resolving discrepancies and transforming complex datasets into reliable, decision-ready analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design post-sales processes and drive adherence across the renewals and CS teams — monitoring compliance, flagging drift, and partnering with team leads to close gaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain reporting on utilization, product adoption, and expansion for the existing customer base to inform retention and growth strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Sales Strategy, Business Operations, Finance, and Customer Success leadership to translate data into recommendations that improve renewal rates, reduce churn, and grow revenue retention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support quarterly/annual reporting on post-sales performance — bookings, pipeline health, and key trends — for business reviews and leadership presentations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a working understanding of renewals and CS operating models to identify risk, inconsistency, and improvement opportunities across the post-sales org.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
