&lt;li&gt;2+ years in management consulting, Sales/Business Operations, financial analysis, or another highly quantitative role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working with large datasets to build models, run analyses, and surface trends&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Salesforce, Tableau, or a similar sales/CS tech stack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Post-sales experience (renewals or customer success) a plus, not required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing or driving adoption of operational processes a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication, including comfort influencing stakeholders without direct authority&lt;/li&gt;
