&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical acumen&lt;/strong&gt;: Build technical depth across the team so CSMs can engage credibly on complex, technical customer challenges — knowing when to go deep personally and when to bring in Product or Support&lt;/li&gt;
